        <div class="section-heading__title">
            <h4>Pre-Clinical Science Lab</h4>
        </div>

        <p>
            Our Pre-Clinical Science Lab provides a strong foundation for nursing students through hands-on training in
            a simulated clinical environment. It is designed to bridge the gap between theory and practice, helping
            students build confidence and essential patient care skills.
        </p>

        <p>
            The lab features advanced mannequins for patient care training, anatomical models, microscopes, and
            demonstration materials that help students understand human anatomy, physiology, and basic clinical
            procedures effectively. Under the guidance of experienced faculty, students gain early exposure to patient
            care techniques such as bed-making, positioning, hygiene practices, and basic nursing procedures.
        </p>

        <p>
            Our Pre-Clinical Science Lab plays a vital role in shaping competent, skilled, and compassionate healthcare
            professionals. The lab environment is structured to promote accuracy, discipline, and professional ethics,
            preparing students for hospital-based training and future healthcare responsibilities.
        </p>
    </div>

