    <div>
        <div class="section-heading__title">
            <h4>
                Nursing Foundation Lab
            </h4>
        </div>

        <p>
            Our Nursing Foundation Lab is designed to equip students with essential nursing skills in a safe and
            controlled environment. It provides hands-on training that builds confidence and prepares students for real
            clinical settings.
        </p>

        <p>
            The Nursing Foundation Lab is a vital part of our academic infrastructure, where students begin their
            journey into professional nursing practice. Designed to simulate a real hospital environment, the lab
            enables students to learn, practice, and master essential nursing procedures before entering clinical
            settings.
        </p>

        <p>
            Students receive hands-on training in fundamental skills such as patient care, vital signs monitoring,
            infection control, wound dressing, and medication administration. The lab is equipped with hospital beds,
            mannequins, and a wide range of instruments that help students develop accuracy, confidence, and competence.
        </p>

        <p>
            With continuous guidance from experienced faculty, students are trained to follow standard protocols,
            maintain hygiene, and uphold ethical practices. This practical exposure ensures they are well-prepared to
            deliver safe, effective, and compassionate care in real healthcare environments.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="side-by-side">
        <img src="/images/Lab/Nursing Foundation Lab.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Nursing Foundation Lab">
