    <div>
        <div class="section-heading__title">
            <h4>
                OBG Nursing Lab (Obstetrics & Gynaecology)
            </h4>
        </div>

        <p>
            The OBG Nursing Lab focuses on maternal and women’s healthcare training with simulation-based learning.
        </p>

        <p>
            Our OBG Nursing Lab is specially designed to provide comprehensive training in maternal and women’s
            healthcare. It offers a simulated clinical environment where students gain hands-on experience in obstetric
            and gynaecological procedures.
        </p>

        <p>
            The lab is equipped with advanced mannequins and anatomical models that help students understand pregnancy,
            childbirth, and reproductive health in a practical way. Students are trained in essential skills such as
            antenatal and postnatal care, conducting normal delivery procedures (simulation), newborn care, and
            assisting in gynaecological examinations.
        </p>

        <p>
            Under the guidance of experienced faculty, students develop confidence, precision, and compassionate care
            practices required for handling maternal and neonatal cases effectively.
        </p>
    </div>

